NOTE ON DATA LICENSING

This MIT license covers the analysis CODE in this directory only. The datasets
the code retrieves are licensed separately by their providers, and some carry
terms more restrictive than MIT:

  - Copernicus GLO-30 DEM (via OpenTopography): Copernicus / ESA licence, free
    for any use with attribution.
  - FABDEM (University of Bristol): CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 -- NON-COMMERCIAL use only.
    This is the most restrictive dependency; commercial users must substitute
    a different DEM.
  - GPM IMERG (NASA): open, no restriction, attribution requested.
  - GloFAS reanalysis (Copernicus Emergency Management Service): Copernicus
    licence, free for any use with attribution.
  - BIPAD Portal gauge stage (Government of Nepal): public government data;
    no explicit open licence published at time of writing.

Derived result files committed under `outputs/` and `data/processed/` are
outputs of the above sources and inherit their terms. Users redistributing
this work should verify each provider's current terms.
